                                       This parameter can be any value between Min_addr = 0 and Max_addr = 1K   */

  uint16_t  pmaaddr1;             /*!< PMA Address1
                                       This parameter can be any value between Min_addr = 0 and Max_addr = 1K   */

  uint8_t   doublebuffer;         /*!< Double buffer enable
                                       This parameter can be 0 or 1                                             */
